What is it? Put him on.

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:14.520
At the airport in half an hour.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.320
I'm afraid you'll have to delay it, sir.

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:18.180
I'll explain when I get there.

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:19.690
Yeah, but it is important.

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.220
Yes, yes, just as quickly as I can make it.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:24.260
About 20 minutes.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:25.210
Goodbye.

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:25.770
Goodbye, sir.

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:28.280
Well, it's none of your business.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:29.460
Trevor speaking.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.780
Uh, have Smith and Jennings meet me at Sir John Haxton's right away, please.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:34.670
Right, sir.

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:38.540
Colonel, why don't you think about getting married?

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.250
Instead of tormenting me with your infernal questions.

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:44.290
I only wanted to tell you that I'd be glad to drop you off at Sir John's.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.580
All right, but I warn you not to ask questions.

00:09:47.990 --> 00:09:48.490
