00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:10.080
On the other hand, it's liable to go off for no reason at all

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:11.660
and lift a fellow into kingdom come.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.240
You are?

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:21.060
