00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:44.080
I'd rather.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.180
I swear I'm flying.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:10.690
An escort waiting for the bush to do it, sir.

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:12.910
But I still think you're making much ado about nothing.

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:13.790
We're taking no chances.

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:14.930
Well, goodbye, Colonel.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:15.630
What a while.

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:03.770
Wire this immediately to the authorities at Le Bourguet.

